{"section":"Section 3: Day-1 Checklist","title":"01-onboarding-policy.md","chroma:document":"On Day 1, the employee must be able to log into Creatics Workday (for payroll and leave), Okta SSO (for all downstream apps), Slack, and their role-specific tools (e.g., GitHub, Jira, Salesforce). Any access gaps must be logged as a P2 ticket in Creatics ServiceDesk queue `IT-ACCESS` for same-day resolutio